<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 13.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 13.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 13     June 12   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  274.120     273.660     247.020   10.97 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.160     309.160     306.830    0.75 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.440     158.755     158.970   -0.33 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.960	47.006	47.182   -0.47 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  446.880     446.920     419.180    6.61 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.870     141.180     141.685   -0.58 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.122	16.124	16.185   -0.39 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  239.490     240.000     212.430   12.74 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.875	 1.879	 1.888   -0.69 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.567	 1.567	 1.581   -0.89 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.830     189.645     183.135    3.66 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
